[{"answer":"I didn't feel very well last week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/1-2025-07-04-20-48-19.mp3"},{"answer":"I had a sore throat and a fever.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/2-2025-06-01-11-38-35.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother took me to see the doctor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/2.mp3"},{"answer":"When we got there, the nurse took my name","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/3.mp3"},{"answer":"and said that the doctor would be with me soon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/4.mp3"},{"answer":"The doctor was a very nice man in a white jacket.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I had seen the doctor before when I had my tonsils out at the hospital.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/6.mp3"},{"answer":"The doctor took a light and looked in my ears.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/7.mp3"},{"answer":"He put a stick on my tongue,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/8.mp3"},{"answer":"and he shone his light into my mouth.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/9.mp3"},{"answer":"He looked at my throat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/10.mp3"},{"answer":"He said that my throat was a bit swollen and red.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/11.mp3"},{"answer":"He felt my neck and said my glands were swollen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/12.mp3"},{"answer":"He took my temperature and said that it was quite high.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/13.mp3"},{"answer":"He listened to my heart, and he made me cough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/14.mp3"},{"answer":"He asked me some questions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/15.mp3"},{"answer":"He said he might have to do some tests.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/16.mp3"},{"answer":"He sent me to get some blood taken out of my arm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/17.mp3"},{"answer":"I was scared, but it didn't really hurt.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/18.mp3"},{"answer":"The doctor gave me some pills","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and told me to take one in the morning and one at night.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/20.mp3"},{"answer":"He told me to drink lots of fluids.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/21.mp3"},{"answer":"He told me to get plenty of sleep.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I did exactly what the doctor told me to do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/23.mp3"},{"answer":"It wasn't very long before I was feeling well again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that I might like to be a doctor when I grow up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I would like to make people feel better.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/76-the-doctor-2019-03-29-12-53-10/26.mp3"}]
